#Problem APEX 1.3.23

DOCUMENT();

# Load whatever macros you need for the problem
loadMacros('PGstandard.pl', 'PGML.pl', 'PGcourse.pl');

Context("Numeric");
$a = random(4, 16, 4);
$b = Compute("3*$a");
$l = Compute("0");

BEGIN_PGML
Evaluate the limit:

[``
  \lim\limits_{x\rightarrow\frac{\pi} {[$a]}}\tan([$b]x) = 
``] [_]{$l}{10}

Enter *DNE* if the limit does not exist.

END_PGML

BEGIN_PGML_SOLUTION
The limit is
[```
\lim\limits_{x\rightarrow\frac {\pi} {[$a]}}\tan([$b] x)= 
\tan([$b] \cdot \frac {\pi}{[$a]}) 
= \tan(3\pi)
= [$l].  
```]

END_PGML_SOLUTION

ENDDOCUMENT();


